      "created_at": "2016-01-10T17:26:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don't have Villains, yet, but I think I can predict the number of cards it will have. Anyone want to check my numbers?</p><div>NOTE: This is just for the smaller cards, so doesn't include the Vengeance/Villains character cards or the Kismet/Infinitor promos.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><ul><li>EE - 578 (41x10 + 27x4 + 15x4 = 410 + 108 + 60)</li></ul><ul><li>RC - 222 (41x2 + 27x4 + 2/Operative + 15x2 = 82 + 108 +2 + 30)</li></ul><ul><li>IR - 228 (41x2 + 27x4 + 8/Ennead + 15x2 = 82 + 108 +8 + 30)</li></ul><ul><li>ST - 220 (41x2 + 27x4 + 15x2 = 82 + 108 + 30)</li></ul><ul><li>Vengeance - 339 (41x5 + 4/Sentinels + 20x5 + 15x2 = 205 +4 + 100 + 30)</li></ul><ul><li>WC - 224 (41x2 + 2/Sky-Scraper, 27x4 + 2/Kaargra + 15x2 = 82 +2 + 108 +2 + 30)</li></ul><ul><li>Villains - 260 (20x10 + 15x4 = 200 + 60)</li></ul><ul><li>Mini-expansions - 276 (41x3 + 27x4 + 15x3 = 123 + 108 + 45)</li></ul><ul><li>Promo Heroes - 37 (YL-1, RCW-1, Ra-1, Fanatic-1, DV-1, EH-1, F6-6, DWatch-4,&nbsp;<span>GIL/B-2, SST-1, Prime Wardens-5, Knyfe-1, Kvothe-1,&nbsp;</span><span>TNat-3, Santa Guise-1, SI-1, HN-1, CR-1, Se-4)</span>\n</li></ul><ul><li>Promo Villains - 8 (Omni, BB, Spite, Gloom, 2 each)</li></ul><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Total: 2,407</div>",
