      "created_at": "2016-01-10T17:34:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It looks like you counted Celestial Tribunal as an environment from Villains rather than being a mini-expansion. It also list 4 mini-expansion heroes, which there is only 3 (Unity, The Scholar, and Guise). Likewise, it only has 3 Villain mini-expansions instead of the 4 (Ambusade, Miss Information, Wager Master, and Chokepoint) that currently exist. Unless of course you intentially excluded Miss information, which I totally would!</p>",
